WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:04.221
Unit seven. Understanding Usernames!

2
00:00:05.169 --> 00:00:10.150
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.889
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:18.237
Today we learn about Understanding Usernames. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.995 --> 00:00:23.229
Username. Say it with me. Username!

6
00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:30.731
Login. Say it with me. Login!

7
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:38.702
Identity. Say it with me. Identity!

8
00:00:42.232 --> 00:00:46.032
Unique. Say it with me. Unique!

9
00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:53.292
Account. Say it with me. Account!

10
00:00:56.835 --> 00:01:00.735
Create. Say it with me. Create!

11
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:08.346
Remember. Say it with me. Remember!

12
00:01:11.828 --> 00:01:15.709
Personal. Say it with me. Personal!

13
00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:28.539
A username is a unique name I use to log into an account. It represents my identity online. I create one and remember it.

14
00:01:28.589 --> 00:01:32.458
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:33.462 --> 00:01:38.885
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.935 --> 00:01:40.085
Identity!

17
00:01:41.263 --> 00:01:46.690
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:47.890
Remember!

19
00:01:48.857 --> 00:01:56.799
Did you know? Millions of people use the internet, so choosing a unique username helps you stand out from others!

20
00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:59.190
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:00.072 --> 00:02:10.228
Think and answer. Why might it be a good idea to keep your username simple but unique?

22
00:02:10.278 --> 00:02:11.444
Great answer!

23
00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:18.004
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:18.054 --> 00:02:21.265
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

